 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Remote and hybrid work (POL-REM-01): Office-based employees may work remotely up to 2 days a week, agreed with their manager. Fully remote arrangements need VP approval. Working from another country is allowed for up to 20 working days per calendar year and needs HR approval at least 2 weeks in advance.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
